+            <p>
+              Observed {view.provenance.derivedAt.slice(0, 10)}. Services marked "From the site
+              data" are read from the business's service records; services marked "Added by the owner"
+              were added by the business owner.
+            </p>
+            {view.ownerUpdatedAt && (
